  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M.Vijayaragavan vs / on 30 January, 2023 W.P.(Md) No. Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 30.01.2023 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice K.Kumaresh Babu W.P.(Md) No.10915 of 2014 M.Vijayaragavan ... Petitioner /vs./ 1.Commissioner of Food Safety, Dms Campus, Tenampet, Chennai -6. 2.The District Collector, Thanjavur District, Thanjavur. 3.Vestige Marketing (P) Limited, A-94/3 Okhla Industrial Area, Phase-II, New Delhi 110 020. ... Respondents Prayer: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of In issuance of Writ of Mandamus, directing the respondents 1 & 2 to take p action against the 3rd respondent in terms of the Food Safety and Stand 2006 based on the representation dated 09.06.2014. 1/4 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.(Md) For Petitioner : Mr.M.Suresh Kumar For R1 & R2 : Mrs.D.Farjana Ghoushia Special Government Plead For R3 : Mr.S.Saravana Muthu Order",
    "facts": "The writ petition is seeking for a Mandamus to direct the respondents 1 and 2 to take proper action against the third respondent in terms of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, based on the representation dated 09.06.2014. 2.The averment made in this writ petition is that the third respondent is carrying on business without any licence and hence, the petitioner has sent a representation to the respondents 1 and 2 to take action against the third respondent. As no action was taken against the third respondent, the petitioner had preferred this writ petition.",
    "arguments": "He would further submit that the licences have been periodically renewed.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "He would further submit that the licences have been periodically renewed.",
